msgid "`elab`: syntax, evaluation, read-back, type checking"
msgstr "`elab`：構文、評価、読み戻し、型検査"

#: manual/index.md:34
msgid "[tutorial](tutorial/elab.md)"
msgstr "[チュートリアル](tutorial/elab.md)"

